 and is reported separately.\n\n**Causes to investigate when tracking error exceeds the mandate's range**\n\n**Portfolio**\n- Sampling or optimization versus full replication, and resulting active weights\n- Cash drag and cash buffer levels\n- Timing of index reconstitutions, rebalances, and corporate actions\n- Weight drift, caps, and liquidity-constrained holdings\n\n**Pricing**\n- Fair-value adjustments and closing-price timing versus benchmark pricing\n- Non-synchronous or stale prices\n- FX rate sources and fixing times\n- Dividend accrual and withholding assumptions\n\n**Operating**\n- Execution slippage, commissions, and trade timing\n- Creation/redemption flows and in-kind handling\n- Securities lending income and collateral management\n- Settlement failures and custody issues\n- Benchmark data errors or delayed index updates","ttft_ms":3027,"type":"result","duration_ms":4741,"uuid":"4a5446f1-903d-4a7b-b8de-66ccc4e454d9","ttft_stream_ms":448,"time_to_request_ms":72,"first_content_frame_ms":448,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
